<section id="research" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Research</h2>
    <p>
      I am interested in the next generation of spacecraft that must increasingly reason,
      coordinate and adapt rather than merely execute predetermined commands.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.4rem;">
      Current themes include distributed spacecraft systems, autonomous reconfiguration,
      formation flight, collision avoidance, mission optimisation, spacecraft systems engineering
      and exploration architectures.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .research-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  .research-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .research-links a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
